WEBVTT

00:00.050 --> 00:02.100
AWS bills arrive too late.

00:02.200 --> 00:05.170
Cloudwake keeps your AWS spend in the menu bar.

00:05.250 --> 00:07.300
See who launched what, and what it costs.

00:07.450 --> 00:08.750
Find what's sitting idle.

00:09.600 --> 00:11.410
And get a nudge before the bill does.

00:11.850 --> 00:13.940
Free for one AWS account.

00:14.050 --> 00:14.860
Cloudwake.
